ese terms apply to your order. We may change our terms and conditions at any time, so please do not assume that the same terms will apply to future orders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;'),('ShopTitle','Shop Home'),('ShortcutMenu','1'),('Show_Settled_LastMonth','1'),('ShowStockidOnImages','0'),('ShowValueOnGRN','1'),('SmtpSetting','0'),('SO_AllowSameItemMultipleTimes','1'),('StandardCostDecimalPlaces','2'),('StockUsageShowZeroWithinPeriodRange','0'),('TaxAuthorityReferenceName',''),('UpdateCurrencyRatesDaily','2025-11-12'),('WeightedAverageCosting','0'),('WikiApp','DokuWiki'),('WikiPath','wiki'),('WorkingDaysWeek','5'),('YearEnd','12');
