+<?php
+
+// DEMAND FORECASTING MODULE
+//
+// 1. new tables, 2. marker column on mrpdemands, 3. default parameters and the forecast MRP demand type,
+// 4. scripts (page security), 5. the Forecasting module placed after Manufacturing (including the shift of
+// every www_users.modulesallowed flag list, which is positional), 6. menu items for the roles that hold the
+// security token of each page.
